.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
CPP-API: Abstract interface for custom progress report receivers\&. 

Each #Importer instance maintains its own \fBProgressHandler\fP\&. The default implementation provided by \fBAssimp\fP doesn't do anything at all\&. 
